.TH trellis-tag 1 "" trellis "Trellis Manual"
.SH NAME
trellis\-tag \- Compare package versions against git tags; create what\*(Aqs missing
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrellis tag\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-directory\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compare package versions against git tags; create what\*(Aqs missing
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-directory\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Run as if started in this directory
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
trellis\-tag\-plan(1)
List releasable packages whose current version has no tag yet
.TP
trellis\-tag\-create(1)
Create missing tags in topological order
